+// The game's own "Achievements" menu item (XamShowAchievementsUI, on the game's thread): the quick menu opens on its
+// ACHIEVEMENTS tab.
+void ShowAchievementsList();
+
+// The frame rate and the last second's frame times, as one line.
+std::string StatsText();
+
+// What kind of PS4 this is and its CPU clock, for the log and the ABOUT tab ("PS4 Pro, Boost Mode on").
+std::string ConsoleText();
